# Cross-origin isolation headers (DECISIONS.md #4). REQUIRED for SharedArrayBuffer.
# Netlify/Cloudflare-Pages-style `_headers` file; copied into the build output so
# the static host sets COOP/COEP. Without these, crossOriginIsolated === false and
# the blocking bridge cannot work.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
